      <div class="finding-k">
        <span class="mono">Task 01</span>
        <span class="finding-score">6/6</span>
      </div>
      <div class="finding-t">Explore community &amp; discover</div>
      <div class="finding-b">All participants successfully browsed attendees and understood the filtering system.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="finding">
      <div class="finding-k">
        <span class="mono">Task 02</span>
        <span class="finding-score">5.5/6</span>
      </div>
      <div class="finding-t">Set availability &amp; schedule</div>
      <div class="finding-b">One participant hesitated on the two-step flow. Minor UX friction, easily resolved.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="finding">
      <div class="finding-k">
        <span class="mono">Task 03</span>
        <span class="finding-score">5/6</span>
