<section class="closing">
  <div class="closing-kicker">Key insight</div>
  <blockquote class="closing-quote">
    Context before capability.<br>
    <em>Stop asking what the feature can do.</em><br>
    Start asking where the user is while he uses it.
  </blockquote>
</section>

